                <pb facs="0141" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1936v05/pg42"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/374: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Muccio</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-02-08T20:00:00-04:00">February 8, 1936—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 9 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. Bolivian Congress has just approved Buenos Aires protocol by joint Senate,
                    Chamber of Deputies unanimous vote. Repeated to Buenos Aires.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Muccio</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
